# Build context for the OPC UA server image (highbyte/components/opc-server/Dockerfile).
# ALLOWLIST: everything is excluded except what that Dockerfile COPYs, so the
# CDK asset staging carries only the server sources and the three gzip datasets
# — never the HighByte setup Lambda, the SiteWise tooling or any local residue.
*
!components/opc-server/**
!datasets/site1_milwaukee_bottling.csv.gz
!datasets/site2_detroit_automotive.csv.gz
!datasets/site3_cedarrapids_food.csv.gz
!datasets/site4_indianapolis_machining.csv.gz
# Local residue that the allowlist above would otherwise re-include.
components/opc-server/node_modules/
components/opc-server/datasets/
